  "descriptionHtml": "<div class='product-description'>Mixed perforated genuine and synthetic leather upper for premium durability and breathabilitySleek low profile with lightly padded tongue and collar allows for comfortable mobilitySignature Swoosh brandingClassic lacesPadded midsole offers cushioned comfortPatterned rubber cupsole construction ensures elevated traction and gripThe Nike Dunk Low Casual Shoes are imported.Shrunken to fit little feet, the Little Kids' Nike Dunk Low Casual Shoes are both a current staple and classic. An evergreen design that never goes out of style, their updated look is the ideal mix of retro and modern. Now in a sleek low profile, they boast beloved details such as signature branding, comfort and traction.</div>\n\n<div class=\"product-specifications\" style=\"margin: 20px 0;\">\n  <h3 style=\"font-size: 16px; margin-bottom: 8px;\">Specifications</h3>\n  <table style=\"width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; font-size: 14px;\">\n    <tbody><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Brand</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Nike</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Model</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Little Kids' Nike Dunk Low Casual Shoes</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Gender</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Kids'</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Sizing Category</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Preschool</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Color</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Black</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Manufacturer SKU</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>3490478</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Category</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Shoes</td></tr></tbody>\n  </table>\n</div>\n\n\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin: 20px 0; padding: 12px; border: 1px solid #e0e0e0; border-radius: 6px;\">\n  <summary style=\"font-weight: 600; cursor: po